<title>USA: Millicom to buy back unspecified number of shares.</title>
<headline>Millicom to buy back unspecified number of shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millicom International Cellular SA said Monday its board of directors has authorized a stock repurchase program, but did not say how many shares would be involved.</p>
<p>The company added that the number of shares to be bought back will reamin at the discretion of the company.</p>
<p>Millicom is a developer and operator of cellular phone serfices in Asia, Latin America and Europe and Africa.</p>
</text>
